{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Ask</b> — It is the way of a father to bequeath to a son; therefore he said: \"and I shall give nations as your inheritance.\"" "<b>Ends of the earth</b> — From the root of כי אפס כסף. Places are derived from settled land."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:02.458643338Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}